# LF everywhere, also in Windows checkouts (the Makefiles and sh scripts need it), except the
# Windows launchers: cmd.exe and Windows PowerShell want CRLF
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
/GETTING\ STARTED.txt text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wasm binary
*.s64hack binary
*.z64 binary
*.iso binary
